{"id":"vierge","lemma":"vierge","pos":"adj","rank":1833,"glosses":["virgin","blank (of paper, recording/storage media, etc.)"],"ipa":"/vjɛʁʒ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ed/Fr-vierge.ogg/Fr-vierge.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"vierges"},"examples":[{"text":"Je suis Vierge.","en":"I'm a Virgo.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Jetons-le et recommençons avec une feuille vierge.","en":"Let's throw it away and start over with a clean slate.","words":[{"g":"a game chip or token","l":"jeton"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to restart","l":"recommencer"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"leaf"},null]},{"text":"La Vierge Marie est la mère de Jésus.","en":"The Virgin Mary is Jesus' mother.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to marry, to marry off","l":"marier"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}